Cell["\<\
points may be plain coordinate lists or labeled coordinate rules.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->2024086573,ExpressionUUID->"41f0e476-ca1d-1140-9171-6cfe0786139d"],

Cell["\<\
Sums squared eigenvector amplitudes over each site's internal states and \
omits site weights below 1.*^-4.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1747808008,ExpressionUUID->"2220c248-e076-5647-9c7c-c7868beb1304"],

Cell["\<\
The eigenvector length must equal Length[points] times internalDimension. \
Three-dimensional coordinates are projected onto the first two coordinates \
and combined by position.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1211446336,ExpressionUUID->"a5b0db2a-3323-5a43-b885-2a60ca078b1f"],

Cell["\<\
The output includes a convex-hull outline and an energy label. radiusScale \
scales disk radii.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->407087047,ExpressionUUID->"93d07277-bb2b-de47-a1b4-886c665401c4"]
}, Closed]],

